# PQ-004: Exchange a chloride precipitate for a less soluble iodide
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 AgNO3 0.0005mol
add v1 NaCl 0.0005mol
new
filter v1 v2
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 KI 0.0006mol
inspect v1
measure v1 eyes
inspect
